OL,3,GNEWSATalks over Plaid #10 child poverty
OL,4,Apayment positive, says Welsh secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FWelsh Secretary Stephen Kinnock says
OL,7,F"positive" talks are taking place over
OL,8,FPlaid Cymru's flagship plans for a
OL,9,Fpayment for Wales' poorest parents.
OL,11,FPlaid ministers in Cardiff want to
OL,12,Ftrial offering #10 a week for 15,000
OL,13,Fchildren aged under six, in households
OL,14,Falready receiving universal credit
OL,15,F(UC).
OL,17,FFinance Minister Elin Jones has asked
OL,18,Ffor the payment - known as Cynnal - to
OL,19,Fbe exempt from taxation and disregarded
OL,20,Ffrom benefits.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
