OL,3,GNEWSATalks over Plaid #10 child poverty
OL,4,Apayment positive, says Welsh secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FJones said she could not see a reason
OL,7,Fwhy the UK government could not move
OL,8,Fquickly.
